OL,3,AGovernment risks missing climate
OL,4,Atargets if EV rules weakened, adviser
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK is likely to miss legally
OL,8,Fbinding climate targets if the
OL,9,Fgovernment reduces electric vehicle
OL,10,F(EV) targets, independent adviser the
OL,11,FClimate Change Committee (CCC) has
OL,12,Fwarned.
OL,14,FIn a letter to Transport Secretary
OL,15,FHeidi Alexander, the CCC argues that
OL,16,Fweakening the targets would result in
OL,17,F"economic and energy security costs"
OL,18,Fand leave households "more exposed to
OL,19,Fvolatile fossil fuel prices".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
