OL,3,AGovernment risks missing climate
OL,4,Atargets if EV rules weakened, adviser
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe CCC says that switching to an
OL,8,Felectric vehicle can save a typical
OL,9,Fhousehold around #800 a year, with
OL,10,Ffewer people benefiting if the targets
OL,11,Fwere watered down.
OL,13,FThe warning comes after weeks of
OL,14,Fspeculation that the government plans
OL,15,Fto announce changes to the EV targets.
OL,16,FGovernment sources insist no decision
OL,17,Fhas been made.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
