OL,3,A'It was really scary': Mother describes
OL,4,Asheltering during Russia strikes on
OL,5,AKyiv bridge
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe alarms warning of a ballistic
OL,8,Fmissile threat went off just before
OL,9,F23:30 on Monday in Kyiv. Moments later
OL,10,Fcame the boom of explosions.
OL,12,FOnce again, the main bridges over the
OL,13,Fbroad River Dnipro that cuts through
OL,14,Fthe city were the target and this time
OL,15,Fthe Russian missiles hit what they
OL,16,Fwanted.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
